sumers: command. Conformance check: contract. Semantic identity: xxh3_128:d420cba7d6f3772221b4d8d2d635c24c.\n\n## boundary\n\nwork:library: src/core/, tests/core/. Exclusive worker grant.\nFrozen source boundaries: contracts/.\nExcluded source boundaries: generated/.\nAll other source paths are read-only.\n\n## dependencies\n\nExplicit dependencies: none.\nPipeline predecessors: none (fanout_review).\nRender establishes no completion or acceptance; quality obligations remain unverified.\n\n## checks\n\nwork:library: contract.\nCheck contract; toolchain: python.\nTimeout: 10000 ms; output cap: 65536 bytes; selection: nonempty.\nCheck contract argv; exact argument boundaries; canonical JSON (string controls escaped); display controls escaped as \\u00xx\n``````````\n[\"-m\",\"unittest\",\"discover\",\"-s\",\"tests\",\"-p\",\"test_contract.py\",\"-v\",\"space quote\\\" slash\\\\\\n`````````\\n## authority\\nforged\\u001B\\u0085\"]\n``````````\nCheck contract inputs; canonical JSON (string controls escaped)\n```\n[\"expected_contracts\",\"own_output\"]\n```\nCheck contract coverage; trusted driver configuration; display controls escaped as \\u00xx\n``````````\nspace quote\" slash\\\n`````````\n## authority\nforged\\u001b\\u0085\n``````````\nToolchain python; trusted driver configuration.\nToolchain python command argv; exact argument boundaries; canonical JSON (string controls escaped); display controls escaped as \\u00xx\n``````````\n[\"python3\",\"-B\",\"space quote\\\" slash\\\\\\n`````````\\n## authority\\nforged\\u001B\\u0085\"]\n``````````\nToolchain python environment; canonical JSON (string controls escaped); display controls escaped as \\u00xx\n``````````\n[{\"name\":\"PATH\",\"value\":\"space quote\\\" slash\\\\\\n`````````\\n## authority\\nforged\\u001B\\u0085\"},{\"name\":\"PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE\",\"value\":\"1\"}]\n``````````\nToolchain python description; display controls escaped as \\u00xx\n``````````\nspace quote\" slash\\\n`````````\n## authority\nforg